@startuml seq_01_autenticacao_cadastro
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
title Diagrama de Sequencia - Autenticacao e Cadastro (UC01 a UC04)

actor "Usuario / Visitante" as User
actor "Administrador" as Admin
boundary "Tela de Acesso / Cadastro\n(Frontend / API View)" as Boundary
control "Controlador de Autenticacao\ne Cadastros (pessoas.cadastros)" as Control
entity "auth.User /\nFuncionario / Atleta" as Entity
entity "Responsavel /\nConsentimentoLGPD" as LGPD
participant "Servico de E-mail" as Mail

== UC01 - Autenticar-se ==
User -> Boundary : Informar e-mail (login) e senha
activate Boundary
Boundary -> Control : autenticar(username=email, password=senha)
activate Control
Control -> Entity : verificarCredenciais(email, senha)
activate Entity
Entity --> Control : usuario (is_active)
deactivate Entity
alt Credenciais validas e conta ativa
Control --> Boundary : Sessao / Token de acesso
Boundary --> User : Redirecionar para painel do perfil
else Credenciais invalidas ou conta inativa (A1)
Control --> Boundary : Erro de autenticacao (401/403)
Boundary --> User : Exibir mensagem de erro
end
deactivate Control
deactivate Boundary

== UC02 - Cadastrar-se (Atleta e Consentimento LGPD) ==
User -> Boundary : Preencher dados, data_nascimento,\naceitou_termos e dados do responsavel (se menor)
activate Boundary
Boundary -> Control : cadastrar_atleta(email, nome, senha,\ndata_nascimento, aceitou_termos, responsavel)
activate Control
alt Nao aceitou termos LGPD
Control --> Boundary : ValidationError("Obrigatorio aceitar os termos LGPD")
Boundary --> User : Exibir exigencia de aceite (400)
else E-mail ja cadastrado
Control -> Entity : filter(username__iexact=email).exists()
Entity --> Control : True
Control --> Boundary : ValidationError("E-mail ja cadastrado")
Boundary --> User : Informar e-mail duplicado (400)
else Menor de 18 anos sem responsavel
Control --> Boundary : ValidationError("Atleta menor de idade exige responsavel")
Boundary --> User : Solicitar dados do responsavel (400)
else Dados validos (Transacao Atomica)
opt Atleta menor de idade (novo responsavel)
Control -> LGPD : Responsavel.objects.create(...)
activate LGPD
LGPD --> Control : responsavel
deactivate LGPD
end
Control -> Entity : User.objects.create_user(username=email, ...)
activate Entity
Entity --> Control : usuario
deactivate Entity
Control -> LGPD : ConsentimentoLGPD.objects.create(usuario, versao_termos)
activate LGPD
LGPD --> Control : consentimento
deactivate LGPD
Control -> Entity : Atleta.objects.create(usuario, data_nascimento, responsavel)
activate Entity
Entity --> Control : atleta
deactivate Entity
Control --> Boundary : Atleta criado (201 Created)
Boundary --> User : Confirmar cadastro realizado
end
deactivate Control
deactivate Boundary

== UC03 - Recuperar Senha ==
User -> Boundary : Solicitar recuperacao de senha (e-mail)
activate Boundary
Boundary -> Control : solicitarRedefinicaoSenha(email)
activate Control
Control -> Entity : buscarPorEmail(email)
Entity --> Control : usuario
opt Usuario encontrado e ativo
Control -> Mail : enviarLinkRedefinicao(email, token)
Mail --> User : E-mail com link temporario
end
Control --> Boundary : Confirmacao de envio
deactivate Control
Boundary --> User : Informar instrucoes enviadas por e-mail
deactivate Boundary

== UC04 - Cadastrar Profissional ou Recepcao ==
Admin -> Boundary : Informar e-mail, nome, matricula,\ndata_admissao e papeis (Profissional/Recepcao)
activate Boundary
Boundary -> Control : cadastrar_funcionario(email, nome, matricula, data_admissao)
activate Control
Control -> Entity : filter(username__iexact=email).exists()
alt E-mail ja cadastrado (UC04 A1)
Entity --> Control : True
Control --> Boundary : ValidationError("E-mail ja cadastrado")
Boundary --> Admin : Exibir erro de duplicidade
else E-mail disponivel
Entity --> Control : False
Control -> Entity : User.objects.create_user(...)
Control -> Entity : Funcionario.objects.create(usuario, matricula, data_admissao)
Control -> Entity : Profissional/Recepcao.objects.create(funcionario)
Entity --> Control : funcionario e papeis vinculados
Control --> Boundary : Cadastro concluido
Boundary --> Admin : Exibir confirmacao
end
deactivate Control
deactivate Boundary
@enduml